  "instance_name": "ironic_juxtaposition_meme_format",
  "label": "Ironic Juxtaposition Meme Format",
  "description": "A common meme structure that places two contrasting or incongruous images together to create a humorous, critical, or satirical effect. In this case, the top image (political rally) is contrasted with the bottom image (man smoking with hands over chest) to imply irony or mockery of the 'freedom of speech' claim. This format relies on understanding meme culture and visual humor conventions.",
